What’s new:

• Turkish PÖH Collection in the new Great Conquests Battle Pass;
• Weapon customization with the ability to change weapons for operators;
• Holiday Gift Hunt event with a new thematic game mode;
• New PvE mission on the Depot map;
• Improved Referral Program;
• And lots of other innovations and improvements!

Don’t forget to enter the game before the end of the year: there’s not only lots of innovations, but also a special gift in the Special Offers section!

Learn more in the patch note and share your impressions with us.

